-1\">Kode Kelas: <span className=\"font-mono bg-peach/50 px-2 py-1 rounded font-bold\">{cls.code}</span></div>\n36:         </div>\n37:       </div>\n38: \n39:       <div className=\"card bg-navy text-white\">\n40:         <h2 className=\"text-xl font-display mb-2\">Instruksi Siswa</h2>\n41:         <p className=\"text-white/80\">\n42:           Siswa dapat membuka halaman <strong>/masuk</strong>, memilih opsi <strong>Kode Kelas</strong>, lalu memasukkan kode <strong className=\"text-sun tracking-widest\">{cls.code}</strong>.\n43:           Mereka dapat memilih nama mereka dan memasukkan PIN, atau mendaftar sebagai siswa baru di kelas ini.\n44:         </p>\n45:       </div>\n46: \n47:       <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n48:         <h2 className=\"text-2xl font-display text-navy\">Daftar Siswa ({cls.students.length})</h2>\n49:         <div className=\"flex gap-2\">\n50:           <a href={`/api/export/kelas/${cls.id}`} className=\"btn-ghost border border-peach text-sm\">Export CSV</a>\n51:           <TeacherAddStudentForm classId={cls.id} />\n52:         </div>\n53:       </div>\n54: \n55:       <div className=\"card\">\n56:         <div className=\"overflow-x-auto\">\n57:           <table className=\"w-full text-left text-sm\">\n58:             <thead>\n59:               <tr className=\"border-b border-peach\">\n60:                 <th className=\"py-3 px-2 text-ink font-medium\">Nama</th>\n61:                 <th className=\"py-3 px-2 text-ink font-medium\">Bintang</th>\n62:                 <th className=\"py-3 px-2 text-ink font-medium\">Status</th>\n63:                 <th className=\"py-3 px-2 text-ink font-medium\">Aksi</th>\n64:               </tr>\n65:             </thead>\n66:             <tbody>\n67:               {cls.students.map(student => {\n68:                 const stars = student.progress.reduce((s, p) => s + p.stars, 0);\n69:                 \n70:                 const attempts7d = student.attempts.filter(a => a.createdAt >= new Date(Date.now() - 7 * 24 * 60 * 60 * 1000));\n71:                 const inactive = attempts7d.length === 0;\n72: \n73:                 const fails14d = student.attempts.filter(a => !a.success).length;\n74:                 const total14d = student.attempts.length;\n75:                 const struggling = total14d >= 6 && (fails14d / total14d) > 0.75;\n76: \n77:                 return (\n78:                   <tr key={student.id} className=\"border-b border-peach/30 hover:bg-peach/10\">\n79:                     <td className=\"py-3 px-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n80:                       <span className=\"text-2xl\">{student.avatar}</span>\n81:                       <span className=\"font-bold text-navy\">{student.nickname}</span>\n82:                     </td>\n83:                     <td className=\"py-3 px-2 text-orange-700 font-bold\">⭐ {stars}</td>\n84:                     <td className=\"py-3 px-2 space-y-1\">\n85:                       {inactive && <div className=\"text-xs bg-peach text-ink px-2 py-1 rounded-full inline-block\">Tidak aktif</div>}\n86:                       {struggling && <div className=\"text-xs bg-orange-100 text-orange-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full inline-block\">Perlu bantuan</div>}\n87:                       {!inactive && !struggling && <div className=\"text-xs bg-leaf-100 text-leaf-700 px-2 py-1 rounded-full inline-block\">Aktif</div>}\n88:                     </td>\n89:                     <td className=\"py-3 px-2\">\n90:                       <Link href={`/dashboard/anak/${student.id}`} className=\"text-navy font-bold hover:underline\">Detail</Link>\n91:                     </td>\n92:                   </tr>\n93:                 )\n94:               })}\n95:               {cls.students.length === 0 && (\n96:                 <tr><td colSpan={4} className=\"py-8 text-center text-ink\">Belum ada siswa di kelas ini.</td></tr>\n97:               )}\n98:             </tbody>\n99:           </table>\n100:         </div>\nThe above content